{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_05_end","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_05","title":"曲径求胜","storyCode":"DH-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"74c57ba02b99c4c73ce0750405388a6362a942078aa6baa2eb54f1e5e7ba5d63","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"陈林二人一走进武器店，店内就发生了爆炸，引得观众席和主持台惊呼。\n废墟中，两人冷静讨论后，解除危机。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，鼠胆龙威队遭到了官方设置的伏兵的围堵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"混战之中，埃内斯托小弟选择了殿后，而接过他钥匙的两位女侠则继续向前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"埃内斯托小弟虽然战斗力同样不俗，但是敌人如此众多，落败也只是时间问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"而反观两位女侠这边，虽然突破了包围圈，但是前方依然有伏兵，她们真的能够顺利逃脱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？她们打开了路边一家店的门然后冲了进去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"这家店......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是埃内斯托开的店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，看来埃内斯托小弟丢给两位女侠的钥匙就是让她们躲入自己的店中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这样真的有效吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，导播，切一下镜头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，从另一角度看过去就明白了，这家店是有后门的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们可以看到，后门有一条直通大道的小路，而这条路还没有被其他阻拦者发现！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"这会是鼠胆龙威队的机会吗，还是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"D.D.D.的话音未落，屏幕中，埃内斯托的武器店就发出巨大的爆炸声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这这这究竟是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"坎黛拉女士，这也是您设置的障碍吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我要设置，那就不是只炸这一家店这么简单了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"这......难道是其他队伍知道埃内斯托小弟有这样的后手而设下的陷阱？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样，那鼠胆龙威队这一次可以说是被彻底算计了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠胆龙威队，难道要折戟于此了吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好过分......陈小姐和林小姐不会有事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，她们两个都是老江湖，这点爆炸死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过嘛......虽然这种比赛使绊子不奇怪，但这也有点太针对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_203_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈这是和谁结梁子了吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伏兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，这家伙，怎么回事，根本打不着他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......那边好像是陈姐姐她们去的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"水月","speakerId":"avg_437_mizuki_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是过去看一看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈晖洁，你没死吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳，死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没死就好。你的车呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，对方也没想要置我们于死地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凑巧，出口被堵住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好一个凑巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想办法出去，还能怎么看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是问，谁干的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们的直觉看来没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。埃内斯托看起来绷不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你不觉得有些奇怪吗？如果我是他，我不会这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有走投无路的人会用这种自爆式的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要么，确实不是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要么，他想让我们以为他走投无路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞挑了挑眉毛，没有接话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你把这件事告诉坎黛拉女士了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎么说？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不会做任何事......吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，陈世侄，你是个聪明人，你应该想得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我派人去排查炸弹的话，不是等于在告诉幕后黑手我发现了他的阴谋吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，陈世侄，你和林世侄已经做得很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，我一开始根本没有期待你们真的能查出什么，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好像一点都不担心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，陈世侄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不用太关心这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你和林世侄在大奖赛里也表现得很好，与其去想这些，不如努努力把第一拿下来，这样魏彦吾脸上也有光嘛，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会考虑的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该想象得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起这个，怎么出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听说特别督察组组长在出任务的时候，一怒之下能把房子切成块，让我见识一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是所有的房子都能那么切。这座房子明显用了非常坚硬的材质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你使沙子的能力能不能搬运一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又不是我爸，这个堵塞程度，用我的能力也要花一些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还是我来试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。我有别的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么方法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜这是什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......炸弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得我在第一轮找到的炸弹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没有办法让坎黛拉女士大规模地去搜查，但是我让我在这边收下的小弟装成小偷去居民区尽可能地偷了一些出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小偷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小偷。只要稍微贿赂一下守卫，进去不闹太大动静，没人会管你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然道不同，但我过去一向敬重你与林先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"贫民窟没有你们撑不下去，这我还是知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让我看到你乐在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......陈晖洁，没有人会主动给自己找罪受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闪开，我要安装炸弹了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
